Step 3: Multiple Sequence Alignment (MEGA 12)
Open MEGA 12.
Create a new alignment.
Import the multi-FASTA file.
Perform ClustalW Multiple Sequence Alignment.
Save the alignment file.

Deliverable

Alignment screenshot
Alignment file (.meg)
Step 4: Construct a Phylogenetic Tree
Open the aligned sequences in MEGA 12.
Select Phylogeny → Construct/Test Neighbor-Joining Tree.
Use default parameters (or Bootstrap = 1000 if covered in class).
Generate the phylogenetic tree.

